sequenceDiagram
    Student ->> UMS: Login
    UMS ->> Student: Authenticated Session
    Student ->> ES: Enroll in Course
    ES ->> AMS: Check Prerequisites
    AMS --> ES: Return Prerequisite Status
    ES ->> SS: Check Capacity
    SS --> ES: Return Availability
    ES ->> EVS: Create Enrollment Record
    EVS --> ES: Confirm Enrollment
    ES ->> SS: Update Schedule
    SS --> ES: Confirm Update
    ES ->> CS: Send Notification
    CS --> Student: Enrollment Confirmation